  "plain": "A researcher, Steven Greer, says that very recently an executive at Lockheed, a big American aerospace and weapons company, admitted to a Navy fighter pilot named David Fravor that the Tic Tac was theirs. The Tic Tac is the white oval object, shaped like the mint, that Fravor reported meeting. If true, the famous object would be a secret human-made aircraft and not something from elsewhere."
